/* v36 sectioned render cache.
   One uint still stores an 8-block vertical section-column using 4 bits per block:
       bits  0.. 3 = y0
       bits  4.. 7 = y1
       ...
       bits 28..31 = y7
   Instead of storing every vertical section for every cached x/z column,
   TinyCraft builds one 8x8x8 scratch section while remeshing. Rendered
   section meshes are retained and indexed by x/z chunk plus vertical section. */
